{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的音乐细节和身体感受描写明显少于Y，一些情绪转折的细微层次被压缩了。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样想、为什么收住或转念交代得更连贯，左右分栏也让故事和感受容易分别扫读，普通观众更容易抓住主线。Y的高亮和分时出现的感受词有明显优势，音乐细节、身体体验和情绪层次也更丰富，但部分段落提示过密，尤其短停留段容易让注意力被大量碎词分散。总体而言，X更容易让人听着音乐理解完整故事，Y则胜在感受的细腻程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "030a0d0b-d21b-4d78-8f14-df03a061fe05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182530736726Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:27:22.000751+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ab413bf2d9e417f7f4eef902a66cddacb56bc36f3de688d7ae0ab3a8c524c57", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850